# Galvanic Giant // Storm Reading (CR 715): the Adventure is {5}{U}{U}, an instant, "Draw four cards, then discard two cards." Bot1 has a
# Galvanic Giant on the battlefield, and casts a second Giant's Adventure with a Black Lotus's three blue, an Island, and three Moxen:
# exactly seven. Its mana value on the stack is 7 (CR 202.3e), so the first Giant triggers and Bot1 chooses Memnite, not the Ornithopter,
# to be tapped and stunned. The Adventure draws four and discards two (the cards drawn are in the hand to choose from, CR 701.9), and
# the card is exiled, not put into the graveyard (CR 715.4). On turn 5 Bot1 casts the Giant from exile for {3}{U}: its mana value 4
# does not trigger the first Giant, so the Ornithopter takes no counter.

